WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Start and pair PCRC on your Windows PC.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Open ChatGPT Plugins and choose Add custom MCP server.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.100
Enter the name and the public PCRC server URL. Keep OAuth selected.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:19.900
Review the warning before choosing Create as a plugin.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:22.800
Choose Connect PC Remote Commander.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.900
Review the account and permissions on the PCRC consent screen.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:31.900
In a new chat, select PCRC and try a read-only connection check.
